{"classified_as":[{"_id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300033799","label":"oil paintings (visual works)","type":"Type"},{"_id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300033618","label":"paintings (visual works)","type":"Type"},{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/object/8595","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"catalogue raisonnée number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026061"}],"content":"512","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"8595","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"non-preferred identifiers","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300264273"}],"content":"512, Catalogue Raisonné","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"non-preferred identifiers","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300264273"}],"content":{"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne":{"titles":[{"notes":"","title":"Gray Tree","type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"},{"title":"Maple Tree","type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}],"type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"},"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne":{"titles":[{"notes":"Source of title: Whitney Archive, Downtown Gallery Archive, Abiquiú Notebooks.","title":"Grey Tree, Lake George","type":"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}],"type":"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}},"type":"Name"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Grey Tree, Lake George","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Georgia O'Keeffe","id":"actor/2","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"provenance_narrative","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/provenance_narrative"}],"content":"The artist (1925–d. 1986; her bequest as part of the Alfred Stieglitz Collection to MMA) (Source: The Met, 2025)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"A dynamic, abstract tree occupies the center of the composition, running from the bottom to the top of the canvas. The tree's gray branches and trunk seem to emit wisps of smoke, interacting with the abstracted gray, green, and brown forms in the background.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Title and Date","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_title_date"}],"content":"Grey Tree, Lake George, 1925","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Complete","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_complete"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe. Grey Tree, Lake George, 1925. Oil on canvas, 36 x 30 inches. Metropolitan Museum of Art (The Met). Alfred Stieglitz Collection, Bequest of Georgia O'Keeffe, 1986. © Metropolitan Museum of Art (The Met)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Measurement Description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/measurement_description"}],"content":"36 x 30 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"cr_remarks_1999","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/cr_remarks_1999"}],"content":["Whitney Archive indicates, \"Exam. at Amer. Place, March 1946. . . . No signature [notes inscriptions 3, 4]. Note: Miss O'Keeffe thinks in 1926 exhibition –– painted 1925.\" Abiquiú Notebooks indicates, \"Note: pale green and grey.\" Reproduced and titled *The Maple* in *Modern American Painters* (1930); *Maple Tree – November* in *The Chicago Evening Post*, (March 1926); reproduced in *Modern Art* (1926). (Source: Lynes, 1999)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"selected_references","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/selected_references"}],"content":"Blanche C. Matthias. \"Georgia O'Keeffe and the Intimate Gallery: Stieglitz Showing Seven Americans.\" Chicago Evening Post Magazine of the Art World (March 2, 1926), p. 1, as \"Maple Tree—November\". \n \nKatherine S. Dreier and Constantin Aladjalov, ed. \"Georgia O'Keeffe.\" Modern Art. New York, 1926, ill. \n \nSamuel M. Kootz. Modern American Painters. New York, 1930, p. 43, ill., as \"The Maple,\" collection Alfred Stieglitz. \n \nLisa Mintz Messinger. Georgia O'Keeffe. New York, 1988, pp. 19, 33, 35, 37–38, fig. 24. \n \nLisa M. Messinger in The Landscape in Twentieth-Century American Art: Selections from The Metropolitan Museum of Art. Exh. cat., American Federation of Arts. New York, 1991, p. 27, fig. 3. \n \nMaria Costantino. Georgia O'Keeffe. New York, 1994, p. 68, ill. \n \nKatherine Hoffman. Georgia O'Keeffe: A Celebration of Music and Dance. New York, 1997, pp. 54, 108–9, 119, pl. 34. \n \nBarbara Buhler Lynes. Georgia O'Keeffe: Catalogue Raisonné. New Haven, Conn., 1999, vol. 1, p. 288, no. 512, ill. \n \nLisa Mintz Messinger. Georgia O'Keeffe. London, 2001, pp. 64–65, fig. 39. \n \nBarbara Buhler Lynes with Russell Bowman. O'Keeffe's O'Keeffes: The Artist's Collection. Exh. cat., Milwaukee Art Museum. New York, 2001, pp. 165 (app. 1), 167 (app. 1), 170 (app. 3), 173 (app. 4). \n \nLisa Mintz Messinger in Stieglitz and His Artists: Matisse to O'Keeffe. The Alfred Stieglitz Collection in The Metropolitan Museum of Art. Ed. Lisa Mintz Messinger. Exh. cat., The Metropolitan Museum of Art. New York, 2011, pp. 14, 198, 279, no. 182, ill. (color). \n \nIsabelle Duvernois in Stieglitz and His Artists: Matisse to O'Keeffe. The Alfred Stieglitz Collection in The Metropolitan Museum of Art. Ed. Lisa Mintz Messinger. Exh. cat., The Metropolitan Museum of Art. New York, 2011, p. 193. \n \nBruce Robertson in Modern Nature: Georgia O'Keeffe and Lake George. Ed. Erin B. Coe. Exh. cat., The Hyde Collection, Glen Falls, N. Y. New York, 2013, pp. 84–85, 197, no. 42, ill. p. 161 (color).","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Materials description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/materials_description"}],"content":"Oil on canvas","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Holding Institution","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_instituion"}],"content":"Metropolitan Museum of Art (The Met)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Copyright","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_copyright"}],"content":"© Metropolitan Museum of Art (The Met)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"credit line","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026687"}],"content":"Alfred Stieglitz Collection, Bequest of Georgia O'Keeffe, 1986","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Artist(s)","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_artist"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Medium and Dimensions","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_medium_dims"}],"content":"Oil on canvas, 36 x 30 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/884924/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/884924"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io/api/image","type":"InformationObject"}],"format":"application/ld+json;profile='http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json'","type":"DigitalService"}],"type":"DigitalObject"}],"type":"VisualItem"}],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}